{"id":"be9bf15fe8207835","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/568_模态描述逻辑.md","title":"568 模态描述逻辑","display":"568_模态描述逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始名字与显示约定\">1. 原始名字与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念名、角色名与模态指标为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{568}=\\{A_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Role}_{568}=\\{r_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Mod}_{568}=\\{m_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Con}_{568}=\\{A_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Role}_{568}=\\{r_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Mod}_{568}=\\{m_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cname},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{cneg},\n\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{exists},\\operatorname{mbox}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cname},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{cneg},\n\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{exists},\\operatorname{mbox}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\top,\\bot,\\neg C,C\\sqcap D,\\exists r.C,\\Box_mC\">\\(A,\\top,\\bot,\\neg C,C\\sqcap D,\\exists r.C,\\Box_mC\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-概念与包含式\">2. 概念与包含式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{568}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{568}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(C\\sqcap D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{568}\">\\(r\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{568}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists r.C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(\\exists r.C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{568}\">\\(m\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{568}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_mC\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\">\\(\\Box_mC\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>包含式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}\n=\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}\n=\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\equiv D\">\\(C\\equiv D\\)</span> 为两个包含式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqsubseteq D\">\\(C\\sqsubseteq D\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\sqsubseteq C\">\\(D\\sqsubseteq C\\)</span> 的有序对缩写，不是新的判断构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由名字与替换\">3. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>自由名字函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}_{568}:\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Con}_{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Role}_{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Mod}_{568})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}_{568}:\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Con}_{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Role}_{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Mod}_{568})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(A)=\\{A\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(A)=\\{A\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\exists r.C)=\\{r\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\Box_mC)=\\{m\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\exists r.C)=\\{r\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(\\Box_mC)=\\{m\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}_{568}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限支撑替换载体定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{568}=\\{(\\sigma_C,\\sigma_R,\\sigma_M):\\;&amp;\n\\sigma_C:\\mathsf{Con}_{568}\\to\\mathsf{Concept}_{568},\\\\\n&amp;\\sigma_R:\\mathsf{Role}_{568}\\to\\mathsf{Role}_{568},\\quad\n\\sigma_M:\\mathsf{Mod}_{568}\\to\\mathsf{Mod}_{568},\\\\\n&amp;\\{A:\\sigma_C(A)\\ne A\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Con}_{568}),\\\\\n&amp;\\{r:\\sigma_R(r)\\ne r\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Role}_{568}),\\\\\n&amp;\\{m:\\sigma_M(m)\\ne m\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Mod}_{568})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{568}=\\{(\\sigma_C,\\sigma_R,\\sigma_M):\\;&amp;\n\\sigma_C:\\mathsf{Con}_{568}\\to\\mathsf{Concept}_{568},\\\\\n&amp;\\sigma_R:\\mathsf{Role}_{568}\\to\\mathsf{Role}_{568},\\quad\n\\sigma_M:\\mathsf{Mod}_{568}\\to\\mathsf{Mod}_{568},\\\\\n&amp;\\{A:\\sigma_C(A)\\ne A\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Con}_{568}),\\\\\n&amp;\\{r:\\sigma_R(r)\\ne r\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Role}_{568}),\\\\\n&amp;\\{m:\\sigma_M(m)\\ne m\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Mod}_{568})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>合成替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{568}:\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{568}\n\\to\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{568}:\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{568}\n\\to\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=(\\sigma_C,\\sigma_R,\\sigma_M)\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{568}\">\\(\\sigma=(\\sigma_C,\\sigma_R,\\sigma_M)\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{568}\\)</span>，写作</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{568}(C,\\sigma)=C^\\sigma,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{568}(C,\\sigma)=C^\\sigma,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A^\\sigma=\\sigma_C(A),\\quad\n\\top^\\sigma=\\top,\\quad\n\\bot^\\sigma=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A^\\sigma=\\sigma_C(A),\\quad\n\\top^\\sigma=\\top,\\quad\n\\bot^\\sigma=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg C)^\\sigma=\\neg C^\\sigma,\n\\quad\n(C\\sqcap D)^\\sigma=C^\\sigma\\sqcap D^\\sigma,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg C)^\\sigma=\\neg C^\\sigma,\n\\quad\n(C\\sqcap D)^\\sigma=C^\\sigma\\sqcap D^\\sigma,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists r.C)^\\sigma=\\exists \\sigma_R(r).C^\\sigma,\n\\quad\n(\\Box_mC)^\\sigma=\\Box_{\\sigma_M(m)}C^\\sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists r.C)^\\sigma=\\exists \\sigma_R(r).C^\\sigma,\n\\quad\n(\\Box_mC)^\\sigma=\\Box_{\\sigma_M(m)}C^\\sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>包含式替换函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubIncl}_{568}:\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{568}\\to\\mathsf{Incl}_{568},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubIncl}_{568}:\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{568}\\to\\mathsf{Incl}_{568},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\sqsubseteq D)^\\sigma=C^\\sigma\\sqsubseteq D^\\sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\sqsubseteq D)^\\sigma=C^\\sigma\\sqsubseteq D^\\sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念构造树相等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\)</span> 是满足下列且仅下列递归子句的关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B\n\\quad(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{568}),\n\\qquad\n\\top\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\top,\n\\quad\n\\bot\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B\n\\quad(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{568}),\n\\qquad\n\\top\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\top,\n\\quad\n\\bot\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\neg D\n\\Longleftrightarrow C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\neg D\n\\Longleftrightarrow C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_0\\sqcap C_1\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D_0\\sqcap D_1\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(C_0\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D_0\\land C_1\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D_1),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_0\\sqcap C_1\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D_0\\sqcap D_1\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(C_0\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D_0\\land C_1\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D_1),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists r.C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\exists q.D\n\\Longleftrightarrow(r=q\\land C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists r.C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\exists q.D\n\\Longleftrightarrow(r=q\\land C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Box_mC\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\Box_nD\n\\Longleftrightarrow(m=n\\land C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Box_mC\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\Box_nD\n\\Longleftrightarrow(m=n\\land C\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且根构造子不同的两个概念不在该关系中。包含式结构相等定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\sqsubseteq D)\\equiv_{\\mathrm{strIncl},568}(C&#39;\\sqsubseteq D&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}C&#39;\\land D\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\sqsubseteq D)\\equiv_{\\mathrm{strIncl},568}(C&#39;\\sqsubseteq D&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}C&#39;\\land D\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}D&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子，故定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,568}:=\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,568}:=\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理包含式\">4. 公理包含式</h1>\n<p>布尔概念包含公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Id}^{568}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Top}^{568}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bot}^{568}=\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Id}^{568}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Top}^{568}=\\{C\\sqsubseteq\\top:C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bot}^{568}=\\{\\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{MeetL}^{568}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{MeetL}^{568}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{MeetR}^{568}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{MeetR}^{568}=\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>存在限制和模态分配公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{568}\n=\n\\{\\Box_m(C\\sqcap D)\\sqsubseteq(\\Box_mC\\sqcap\\Box_mD):m\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{568},C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{568}\n=\n\\{\\Box_m(C\\sqcap D)\\sqsubseteq(\\Box_mC\\sqcap\\Box_mD):m\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{568},C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{568}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Id}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Top}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bot}^{568}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{MeetL}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MeetR}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{568}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{568}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Id}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Top}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bot}^{568}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{MeetL}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MeetR}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{BoxK}^{568}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>包含传递规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{568}\n=\n\\{((C\\sqsubseteq D,D\\sqsubseteq E),C\\sqsubseteq E):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{568}\n=\n\\{((C\\sqsubseteq D,D\\sqsubseteq E),C\\sqsubseteq E):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>合取引入规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetI}^{568}\n=\n\\{((E\\sqsubseteq C,E\\sqsubseteq D),E\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcap D):E,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetI}^{568}\n=\n\\{((E\\sqsubseteq C,E\\sqsubseteq D),E\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcap D):E,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>存在单调与模态单调规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Exists}^{568}\n=\n\\{((C\\sqsubseteq D),\\exists r.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists r.D):r\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{568},C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Exists}^{568}\n=\n\\{((C\\sqsubseteq D),\\exists r.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists r.D):r\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{568},C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Box}^{568}\n=\n\\{((C\\sqsubseteq D),\\Box_mC\\sqsubseteq\\Box_mD):m\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{568},C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Box}^{568}\n=\n\\{((C\\sqsubseteq D),\\Box_mC\\sqsubseteq\\Box_mD):m\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{568},C,D\\in\\mathsf{Concept}_{568}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>结构相等转换规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{str}^{568}\n=\\{((I),J):I,J\\in\\mathsf{Incl}_{568},\\ I\\equiv_{\\mathrm{strIncl},568}J\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{str}^{568}\n=\\{((I),J):I,J\\in\\mathsf{Incl}_{568},\\ I\\equiv_{\\mathrm{strIncl},568}J\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D\\qquad D\\sqsubseteq E}{C\\sqsubseteq E}\\ (\\mathsf{Trans}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{E\\sqsubseteq C\\qquad E\\sqsubseteq D}{E\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcap D}\\ (\\sqcap\\mathsf I),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D\\qquad D\\sqsubseteq E}{C\\sqsubseteq E}\\ (\\mathsf{Trans}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{E\\sqsubseteq C\\qquad E\\sqsubseteq D}{E\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcap D}\\ (\\sqcap\\mathsf I),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D}{\\exists r.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists r.D}\\ (\\exists\\mathsf{Mon}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D}{\\Box_mC\\sqsubseteq\\Box_mD}\\ (\\Box\\mathsf{Mon}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{I}{J}\\ (\\mathsf{Str}),\\ I\\equiv_{\\mathrm{strIncl},568}J.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D}{\\exists r.C\\sqsubseteq\\exists r.D}\\ (\\exists\\mathsf{Mon}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{C\\sqsubseteq D}{\\Box_mC\\sqsubseteq\\Box_mD}\\ (\\Box\\mathsf{Mon}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{I}{J}\\ (\\mathsf{Str}),\\ I\\equiv_{\\mathrm{strIncl},568}J.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则总关系是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{568}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetI}^{568}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Exists}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Box}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{str}^{568}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{568}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetI}^{568}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Exists}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Box}^{568}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{str}^{568}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}\">\\(\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{568}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{568}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\((I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，下列七项许可条件至少一项成立（外层连接为析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathcal T\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathcal T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{568}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{568}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetI}^{568}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetI}^{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Exists}^{568}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Exists}^{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Box}^{568}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Box}^{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{str}^{568}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{str}^{568}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{568}(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})=I_{m-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{568}(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})=I_{m-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可导包含\">7. 可导包含</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{568}(\\mathcal T)\\ \n\\bigl(\\operatorname{last}_{568}(\\pi)=C\\sqsubseteq D\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\vdash_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{568}(\\mathcal T)\\ \n\\bigl(\\operatorname{last}_{568}(\\pi)=C\\sqsubseteq D\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{568}=\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{568}I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{568}=\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{568}I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-TBox-闭包\">8. TBox 闭包</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}_{568}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}:\\mathcal T\\vdash_{568}I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cl}_{568}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Incl}_{568}:\\mathcal T\\vdash_{568}I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与包含满足\">9. 语义结构与包含满足</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"568\">\\(568\\)</span>-模态描述解释类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MDLMod}_{568}\">\\(\\mathsf{MDLMod}_{568}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(W,(S_m)_{m\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{568}},\\Delta,(\\cdot)^{\\mathcal I,w}_{w\\in W}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I=(W,(S_m)_{m\\in\\mathsf{Mod}_{568}},\\Delta,(\\cdot)^{\\mathcal I,w}_{w\\in W}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_m\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(S_m\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A^{\\mathcal I,w}\\subseteq\\Delta\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{568}),\n\\qquad\nr^{\\mathcal I,w}\\subseteq\\Delta\\times\\Delta\\quad(r\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{568}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A^{\\mathcal I,w}\\subseteq\\Delta\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{568}),\n\\qquad\nr^{\\mathcal I,w}\\subseteq\\Delta\\times\\Delta\\quad(r\\in\\mathsf{Role}_{568}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概念解释递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top^{\\mathcal I,w}=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\bot^{\\mathcal I,w}=\\varnothing,\\quad\n(\\neg C)^{\\mathcal I,w}=\\Delta\\setminus C^{\\mathcal I,w},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top^{\\mathcal I,w}=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\bot^{\\mathcal I,w}=\\varnothing,\\quad\n(\\neg C)^{\\mathcal I,w}=\\Delta\\setminus C^{\\mathcal I,w},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\sqcap D)^{\\mathcal I,w}=C^{\\mathcal I,w}\\cap D^{\\mathcal I,w},\n\\quad\n(\\exists r.C)^{\\mathcal I,w}=\\{d\\in\\Delta:\\exists e\\in C^{\\mathcal I,w}\\ ((d,e)\\in r^{\\mathcal I,w})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\sqcap D)^{\\mathcal I,w}=C^{\\mathcal I,w}\\cap D^{\\mathcal I,w},\n\\quad\n(\\exists r.C)^{\\mathcal I,w}=\\{d\\in\\Delta:\\exists e\\in C^{\\mathcal I,w}\\ ((d,e)\\in r^{\\mathcal I,w})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\Box_m C)^{\\mathcal I,w}\n=\\{d\\in\\Delta:\\forall v\\in W\\,(wS_mv\\Rightarrow d\\in C^{\\mathcal I,v})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\Box_m C)^{\\mathcal I,w}\n=\\{d\\in\\Delta:\\forall v\\in W\\,(wS_mv\\Rightarrow d\\in C^{\\mathcal I,v})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>包含式满足与 TBox 满足定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I,w\\Vdash_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC^{\\mathcal I,w}\\subseteq D^{\\mathcal I,w},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I,w\\Vdash_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nC^{\\mathcal I,w}\\subseteq D^{\\mathcal I,w},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\Vdash_{568}\\mathcal T\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall I\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I,w\\Vdash_{568}I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\Vdash_{568}\\mathcal T\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall I\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I,w\\Vdash_{568}I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\models_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal I=(W,(S_m),\\Delta,(\\cdot)^{\\mathcal I,w})\\in\\mathsf{MDLMod}_{568}\n\\bigl(\\mathcal I\\Vdash_{568}\\mathcal T\\Rightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\mathcal I,w\\Vdash_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T\\models_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal I=(W,(S_m),\\Delta,(\\cdot)^{\\mathcal I,w})\\in\\mathsf{MDLMod}_{568}\n\\bigl(\\mathcal I\\Vdash_{568}\\mathcal T\\Rightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\mathcal I,w\\Vdash_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的主判断是概念包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\vdash_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\">\\(\\mathcal T\\vdash_{568}C\\sqsubseteq D\\)</span>；模态构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m\">\\(\\Box_m\\)</span> 作用于概念而不是公式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MDL}_{568}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Con}_{568},\\mathsf{Role}_{568},\\mathsf{Mod}_{568},\\mathsf{Concept}_{568},\n\\mathsf{Incl}_{568},\\operatorname{FN}_{568},\\mathsf{Subst}_{568},\\operatorname{Sub}_{568},\\operatorname{SubIncl}_{568},\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568},\\equiv_{\\mathrm{strIncl},568},\\equiv_{\\alpha,568},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{568},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{568},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetI}^{568},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Exists}^{568},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Box}^{568},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{str}^{568},\\mathsf{Rule}_{568},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{568},\\operatorname{last}_{568},\\vdash_{568},\\mathsf{Thm}_{568},\\operatorname{Cl}_{568},\n\\mathsf{MDLMod}_{568},(\\cdot)^{\\mathcal I,w},\\Vdash_{568},\\models_{568}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{MDL}_{568}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Con}_{568},\\mathsf{Role}_{568},\\mathsf{Mod}_{568},\\mathsf{Concept}_{568},\n\\mathsf{Incl}_{568},\\operatorname{FN}_{568},\\mathsf{Subst}_{568},\\operatorname{Sub}_{568},\\operatorname{SubIncl}_{568},\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{str},568},\\equiv_{\\mathrm{strIncl},568},\\equiv_{\\alpha,568},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{568},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{568},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetI}^{568},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Exists}^{568},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Box}^{568},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{str}^{568},\\mathsf{Rule}_{568},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{568},\\operatorname{last}_{568},\\vdash_{568},\\mathsf{Thm}_{568},\\operatorname{Cl}_{568},\n\\mathsf{MDLMod}_{568},(\\cdot)^{\\mathcal I,w},\\Vdash_{568},\\models_{568}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含模态描述逻辑的概念、包含式、公理、规则、证明对象、可导关系、解释结构、角色/模态语义与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性、完备性或可判定性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始名字与显示约定","text":"1. 原始名字与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念与包含式","text":"2. 概念与包含式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由名字与替换","text":"3. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理包含式","text":"4. 公理包含式","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导包含","text":"7. 可导包含","level":1},{"id":"8.-TBox-闭包","text":"8. TBox 闭包","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与包含满足","text":"9. 语义结构与包含满足","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Con}_{568}=\\{A_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Role}_{568}=\\{r_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Mod}_{568}=\\{m_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cname},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{cneg},\n\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{exists},\\opera